{"id":"7fc5fa30c0841ef9","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-standard-cnf.md","title":"Chomsky Normal Form","display":"df-chomsky-normal-form — Chomsky Normal Form","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-standard-cnf","aliases":["73-df-standard-cnf","73-df-chomsky-normal-form"],"display":"df-chomsky-normal-form — Chomsky Normal Form","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-standard-cnf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-standard-cnf</span><span>73-df-chomsky-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-chomsky-normal-form — Chomsky Normal Form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"33052f37223a11c6\" href=\"?note=33052f37223a11c6\" title=\"73-df-cfg-structure\">73-df-cfg-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (context-free grammar, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"33052f37223a11c6\" href=\"?note=33052f37223a11c6\" title=\"73-df-cfg-structure\">73-df-cfg-structure</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chomsky\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CNF}(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists B,C\\in V\\;(\\alpha=BC)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\alpha=a)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n(A=S\\land\\alpha=\\varepsilon)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;(S\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chomsky\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CNF}(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists B,C\\in V\\;(\\alpha=BC)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\alpha=a)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n(A=S\\land\\alpha=\\varepsilon)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;(S\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chomsky\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CNF}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{CNF}(G)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chomsky\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CNF}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{CNF}(G)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The optional production <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\to\\varepsilon\">\\(S\\to\\varepsilon\\)</span> handles languages containing the empty word.</li>\n<li>Excluding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> from every right-hand side makes that epsilon exception compatible with the usual CNF conversion theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$ (context-free grammar, see [[73-df-cfg-structure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chomsky\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CNF}(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists B,C\\in V\\;(\\alpha=BC)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\alpha=a)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n(A=S\\land\\alpha=\\varepsilon)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;(S\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chomsky\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CNF}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{CNF}(G)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"S\\to\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1156,"backlinks":[{"id":"67f26c889bc89ed8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CNF}$ 保留原接口的全部三个分支，尤其保留终结产生式的 $A\\ne S$ 条件；不将它替换成 [[73-df-standard-cnf]] 的 $\\operatorname{CNF}$。"},{"id":"7505f1b37c6f6f74","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{CNF}_{\\Sigma}$ (grammars in Chomsky normal form, see [[73-df-standard-cnf]])"}],"outgoing":["33052f37223a11c6"]}